export function routesToKML(routes){const xml=s=>String(s).replace(/[<>&"']/g,c=>({'<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','&':'&amp;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&apos;'}[c]));return '<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>\n<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document>'+routes.map(r=>'<Placemark><name>'+xml(r.name)+'</name><LineString><coordinates>'+r.path.map(p=>p[1]+','+p[0]).join(' ')+'</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>').join('')+'</Document></kml>'}
export function kmlRoutes(text,source='',Parser=globalThis.DOMParser){if(text.length>MAX_XML)throw fail('KML文件过大','KML trop volumineux');if(/<!DOCTYPE|<!ENTITY/i.test(text))throw fail('不支持带DTD或实体声明的KML','DTD et entités non pris en charge');let doc=new Parser().parseFromString(text,'application/xml');if(doc.getElementsByTagNameNS('*','parsererror').length||doc.documentElement?.localName!=='kml')throw fail('KML XML格式无效','XML KML invalide');let lines=[...doc.getElementsByTagNameNS('*','LineString'),...doc.getElementsByTagNameNS('http://www.google.com/kml/ext/2.2','Track')];if(lines.length>50000)throw fail('线段数量超过50000','Plus de 50000 segments');const groups=new Map();let results=lines.map((line,i)=>{let parent=line.parentElement;while(parent&&parent.localName!=='Placemark')parent=parent.parentElement;let label=parent?Array.from(parent.children).find(e=>e.localName==='name')?.textContent:'';let path;if(line.localName==='Track'){path=Array.from(line.getElementsByTagNameNS('http://www.google.com/kml/ext/2.2','coord')).flatMap(e=>coordinates(e.textContent,true));}else{let c=Array.from(line.children).find(e=>e.localName==='coordinates');if(!c)throw fail('线路缺少coordinates','Tracé sans coordinates');path=coordinates(c.textContent)}if(path.length<2||path.length>50000)throw fail('线路需要2至50000个顶点','Le tracé doit contenir 2 à 50000 sommets');let length=path.slice(1).reduce((n,p,j)=>n+distance(path[j],p),0);if(!groups.has(parent))groups.set(parent,groups.size);return {group:groups.get(parent),name:(label?.trim()||'线路 / Tracé')+' · '+(i+1),source,path,length}});return lines.length>256?mergeConnectedRoutes(results):results}
export async function importRoutes(file){if(!file||(/\.csv$/i.test(file.name)&&file.size>MAX_FILE))throw fail('文件最大25 MB','Fichier limité à 25 Mo');let ext=file.name.split('.').at(-1).toLowerCase(),routes=[];if(ext==='csv'){let [header,...rows]=parseCSV(await file.text());if(header?.join(',')!=='latitude,longitude')throw fail('CSV表头应为latitude,longitude','En-tête CSV : latitude,longitude');let path=rows.map(a=>{if(a.length!==2||a.some(v=>!v.trim()))throw fail('CSV坐标无效','Coordonnées CSV invalides');let p=a.map(Number);if(!geo(p))throw fail('CSV坐标超出范围','Coordonnées CSV hors limites');return p});if(path.length<2||path.length>50000)throw fail('线路需要2至50000个顶点','Le tracé doit contenir 2 à 50000 sommets');routes=[{name:file.name,source:file.name,path,length:path.slice(1).reduce((n,p,i)=>n+distance(path[i],p),0)}]}else if(ext==='kml'||ext==='kmz'){if(ext==='kml'&&file.size>MAX_XML)throw fail('KML最大64 MB','KML limité à 64 Mo');let docs=ext==='kmz'?await kmzFileDocuments(file):[{name:file.name,text:decode(new Uint8Array(await file.arrayBuffer()))}];routes=docs.flatMap(d=>kmlRoutes(d.text,d.name))}else throw fail('请选择KMZ、KML或CSV文件','Choisir un fichier KMZ, KML ou CSV');if(!routes.length)throw fail('未发现线路。请导出包含路径LineString的KML/KMZ；仅地标、面或网络链接不能当作线路','Aucun tracé : exporter un LineString. Points, polygones et liens réseau seuls ne constituent pas un tracé');if(routes.length>256)routes.sort((a,b)=>b.length-a.length);return routes}
